<title>USA: CBOT wrong to list 1999 corn, soy contracts --CFTC.</title>
<headline>CBOT wrong to list 1999 corn, soy contracts --CFTC.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade acted without legal authority in listing four corn and soybean contracts for trading in 1999, the Commodity Futures Trading Commission said Monday.</p>
<p>CFTC said it sent a letter to the Chicago exchange instructing it &quot;to notify all market participants that the commission has not approved the listing of these contract months.&quot;</p>
</text>
